Upstream-Name: Stud
Upstream-Contact: CatPieLeaf <catpieleaf@proton.me>
Source: https://github.com/CatPieLeaf/Stud
Comment:
 Stud contains no Roblox code and distributes none. The Roblox application
 package is supplied by the person running Stud, from a source of their own
 choosing, and is not part of this package.
 .
 The full text of every licence named here ships in the binary package
 under /usr/share/licenses/stud/, one directory per component, each with a
 README mapping the files it covers. Where a licence is long and already on
 the system, this file names that path rather than repeating it.

Files: *
Copyright: 2026 CatPieLeaf <catpieleaf@proton.me>
License: AGPL-3.0-or-later with Roblox-Engine exception

Files: third_party/fidelityfx-fsr1/*
Copyright: 2021 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
License: MIT
Comment:
 The upscaler in render-host/shaders/ is EASU and RCAS ported from these
 reference headers, so the notice covers the built shaders too.

Files: third_party/snapdragon-gsr/*
Copyright: 2023 Qualcomm Innovation Center, Inc.
License: BSD-3-Clause
Comment:
 render-host/shaders/sgsr.comp is ported from this reference, so the
 notice covers the built shader too.

Files: third_party/mpv-prescalers/*
Copyright: 2017 Bin Jin
License: LGPL-3.0-or-later
Comment:
 RAVU-Zoom. The shader and its weight tables are generated from these
 hooks, which ship with the package as the Corresponding Source.

Files: third_party/volk/*
Copyright: 2018-2026 Arseny Kapoulkine
License: MIT
Comment:
 Resolves the render host's Vulkan entry points.

Files: third_party/xxhash/*
Copyright: 2012-2021 Yann Collet
License: BSD-2-Clause
Comment:
 Keys the texture cache.

Files: third_party/miniaudio/*
Copyright: 2026 David Reid
License: MIT-0
Comment:
 The render host's audio device. Offered as the Unlicense or MIT-0;
 taken as MIT-0.

Files: third_party/libdecor/*
Copyright: 2017-2018 Red Hat Inc., 2018 Jonas Adahl, 2019 Christian Rauch
License: MIT
Comment:
 The header only, for types. libdecor itself is opened by name at
 runtime and is not redistributed.

Files: third_party/wayland-protocols/*
Copyright: 2023 the wayland-protocols contributors
License: MIT
Comment:
 One staging protocol, used when the host's own copy is too old.

Files: third_party/angle/*
Copyright: 2018 The ANGLE Project Authors
License: BSD-3-Clause
Comment:
 Prebuilt, not built from this source tree. libEGL.so and libGLESv2.so.
 Shipped alongside it, each under its own licence:
 .
   libvk_swiftshader.so             SwiftShader, Apache-2.0
   libvulkan.so.1                   Vulkan-Loader, Apache-2.0
   libVkLayer_khronos_validation.so Vulkan-ValidationLayers, Apache-2.0
   libVkICD_mock_icd.so             Vulkan-Tools, Apache-2.0
 .
 ANGLE statically links further third-party code of its own; the full set
 of notices is in the ANGLE source tree.

Files: third_party/android-bionic/*
Copyright: 2005-2026 The Android Open Source Project
  and the many holders named in the NOTICE files
License: Apache-2.0 and BSD-3-Clause
Comment:
 Prebuilt, taken unmodified from AOSP's Runtime APEX: libc.so, libm.so,
 libdl.so, libdl_android.so, linker64, ld-android.so, liblog.so. bionic is
 largely inherited BSD libc code, so each component's NOTICE runs to
 several hundred separate copyright holders; those NOTICE files are the
 authoritative statement and ship with the package.
 .
 libc++.so is Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, from the LLVM project.
 tzdata is the IANA time zone database, which is in the public domain.

Files: (fetched at build time, not in this source tree)
Copyright: see each project
License: MIT
Comment:
 Built into Stud's own binaries rather than shipped as separate files:
 .
   libjnivm      Christopher Homberger
   nlohmann/json Niels Lohmann
   miniz         Rich Geldreich and contributors
   detex         Hans-Kristian Lemmens
   PVRTDecompress  Imagination Technologies (PowerVR Native SDK)

